## 4. BANCO DE DADOS - SCHEMA

// Tables/Collections

Users {
id, email, password, name, phone, userType (athlete/organizer/academy), createdAt, updatedAt
}

Events {
id, title, description, eventType, sport, date, time, location, address, image,
organizerId, description, requirements, createdAt, updatedAt, status
}

Registrations {
id, eventId, userId, category, status (pending/confirmed/checked-in), paymentStatus,
registeredAt, checkedInAt
}

Categories {
id, eventId, name, price, capacity, registeredCount, description
}

EventSchedule {
id, eventId, phase (registration/payment/checkin/brackets/competition), startDate, endDate
}

Payments {
id, registrationId, amount, method (credit/debit/boleto/transfer), status, transactionId
}

Academies {
id, name, city, state, owner, phone, email, description, logo,
createdAt, eventCount, athleteCount
}

text

## 5. DESIGN/UI

### Paleta de Cores Primária
- Azul Escuro: #1A3A52 (navegação, backgrounds)
- Vermelho/Rosa: #E63946 (CTAs, destaques)
- Laranja: #FF9500 (botão primário "CRIAR EVENTO")
- Branco: #FFFFFF
- Cinza Claro: #F5F5F5 (backgrounds secundários)
- Verde (WhatsApp): #25D366

### Tipografia
- Headings: Font weight 700-900
- Body: Font weight 400-500
- Font family: Inter, Roboto ou similar (sans-serif)

### Spacing/Grid
- Sistema de grid 12 colunas
- Mobile: 1 coluna
- Tablet: 2 colunas
- Desktop: 2-3 colunas (eventos)

### Icons
- Ícones: Feather Icons ou Font Awesome